00:16:59.543 --> 00:17:02.126
What new problem
did you cook-up now?

260
00:17:02.293 --> 00:17:05.917
Majnu, you know that
I got married twice.

261
00:17:05.918 --> 00:17:08.376
But actually I got married thrice.

262
00:17:08.543 --> 00:17:09.751
Three?

263
00:17:10.043 --> 00:17:11.917
Children are crying out for food..

264
00:17:11.918 --> 00:17:13.626
And father's finished
his 3 course-meal.

265
00:17:13.793 --> 00:17:15.626
And I have a daughter.

266
00:17:15.793 --> 00:17:17.210
Daughter?

267
00:17:18.293 --> 00:17:20.126
- You mean another sister.
- Yes.

268
00:17:20.293 --> 00:17:22.750
People normally get sc****

269
00:17:22.751 --> 00:17:24.667
But in this case your
own father's sc**** you.

270
00:17:24.668 --> 00:17:27.000
Well... there's no guarantee
of this father now.

271
00:17:27.001 --> 00:17:28.876
My life-switch can
turn-off any minute.

272
00:17:29.043 --> 00:17:30.443
Are you my father or a ceiling fan?

273
00:17:30.467 --> 00:17:31.001
On-off?

274
00:17:31.168 --> 00:17:32.001
What's wrong with you?

275
00:17:32.168 --> 00:17:35.001
My motor's damaged... Heart.

276
00:17:35.668 --> 00:17:38.875
Just like you got Sanjana
married in a decent family..

277
00:17:38.876 --> 00:17:42.167
I want you to do
the same with Ranjana.

278
00:17:42.168 --> 00:17:43.751
That's all I do.

279
00:17:44.376 --> 00:17:46.336
You keep getting yourselves
a new wife every time.

280
00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:47.960
And we find grooms for our sisters.

281
00:17:48.168 --> 00:17:49.751
I don't have any sister.

282
00:17:50.585 --> 00:17:52.335
But I have a brother.

283
00:17:54.251 --> 00:17:57.376
I thought he'll be
overjoyed to see me.

284
00:17:57.543 --> 00:17:59.042
Hug me..

285
00:17:59.043 --> 00:18:02.335
I didn't know he'll
refuse to accept me.

286
00:18:02.668 --> 00:18:04.167
On every 'Raksha Bandhan'..

287
00:18:04.168 --> 00:18:08.585
I would see my friend's brothers
and wish that I had a brother too.

288
00:18:09.293 --> 00:18:11.125
But when I found out that I do..

289
00:18:11.126 --> 00:18:13.751
I left my exams
in-between to meet him.

290
00:18:13.918 --> 00:18:15.126
Now I've met him.

291
00:18:15.293 --> 00:18:18.001
I guess I'm not destined
for any brotherly love.

292
00:18:18.418 --> 00:18:19.751
Why not?

293
00:18:20.751 --> 00:18:22.126
I am there.

294
00:18:22.501 --> 00:18:26.376
I always wished that...
I had a sister.

295
00:18:26.918 --> 00:18:28.626
And I've found her today.

296
00:18:29.168 --> 00:18:30.876
You're my sister... not his.

297
00:18:31.168 --> 00:18:32.250
I'll get you married.

298
00:18:32.251 --> 00:18:33.500
Majnu!

299
00:18:33.501 --> 00:18:36.750
Let it be, brother.
It's not her fault.

300
00:18:36.751 --> 00:18:39.835
- It's...
- I admit it's my fault.

301
00:18:52.043 --> 00:18:53.043
Come.

302
00:18:54.668 --> 00:18:57.585
Uday, you're exactly like me.

303
00:18:57.918 --> 00:18:59.626
Emotional rascal.

304
00:19:00.876 --> 00:19:06.126
Now I can happily
go on my pilgrimage.

305
00:19:13.668 --> 00:19:18.376
Sunder Shetty... now you
can get married again.

306
00:19:19.043 --> 00:19:22.125
Now I can happily return India
and give my exams.

307
00:19:22.126 --> 00:19:23.626
Your happiness is going to double-up.

308
00:19:23.793 --> 00:19:25.393
Soon you'll have
a sister-in-law as well.

309
00:19:25.417 --> 00:19:27.210
- My wife.
- Or mine.

310
00:19:27.376 --> 00:19:30.292
- Only one of us...
- Is getting married.

311
00:19:30.293 --> 00:19:32.376
This marriage isn't possible,

312
00:19:33.043 --> 00:19:37.042
I mean... only until your
sister doesn't get married.

313
00:19:37.043 --> 00:19:39.750
But what's our marriage
got to do with hers?

314
00:19:39.751 --> 00:19:40.751
Yes, mom.

315
00:19:40.793 --> 00:19:44.001
- Dear, you're forgetting who we are.
- Who?

316
00:19:44.376 --> 00:19:46.876
The Queen and Princess of Nazabgarh.

317
00:19:47.626 --> 00:19:48.986
How can the brothers get married..

318
00:19:49.043 --> 00:19:51.167
When their sister's still unmarried?

319
00:19:51.168 --> 00:19:52.648
What will the people
of Nazabgarh say?

320
00:19:52.672 --> 00:19:54.130
Yes... what will they say?

321
00:19:54.168 --> 00:19:56.292
- How can we find a decent guy so soon?
- Yes.

322
00:19:56.293 --> 00:19:58.625
What's the hurry?
Take your time.

323
00:19:58.626 --> 00:20:01.000
Your sister's not
in a hurry nor are we.

324
00:20:01.001 --> 00:20:02.625
But we are.

325
00:20:02.626 --> 00:20:05.460
Look, call it our
helplessness or our condition.

326
00:20:05.626 --> 00:20:10.167
But we cannot ignore
our tradition and customs.

327
00:20:10.168 --> 00:20:11.168
Let's go, dear.

328
00:20:17.668 --> 00:20:19.126
Boss, don't fire.

329
00:20:19.751 --> 00:20:22.960
- Control, Uday.
- What control?

330
00:20:23.168 --> 00:20:25.449
Where will we find a decent
boy from a respectable family?

331
00:20:34.793 --> 00:20:38.417
- I will kill you today!
- Ghunghroo!

332
00:20:38.418 --> 00:20:39.418
Have you gone crazy?

333
00:20:39.543 --> 00:20:41.542
You never let me stay normal.

334
00:20:41.543 --> 00:20:44.500
You were already married
prior to our marriage.

335
00:20:44.501 --> 00:20:47.000
And you also have a son.

336
00:20:47.001 --> 00:20:50.001
And you hid this
from me until now.

337
00:20:50.168 --> 00:20:52.251
I was going to tell
you on our wedding night..

338
00:20:52.418 --> 00:20:54.258
But you fell asleep
after drinking the milk.

339
00:20:54.282 --> 00:20:55.460
I was only asleep, not dead.

340
00:20:55.626 --> 00:20:57.876
You could've told me the next day,
you wretch.

341
00:20:58.043 --> 00:21:01.501
I tried to tell you,
but you never gave me a chance.

342
00:21:01.668 --> 00:21:04.292
Did you expect me to call
a press-conference to disclose this?

343
00:21:04.293 --> 00:21:07.167
You should be happy that you're a son.

344
00:21:07.168 --> 00:21:08.168
My Son?

345
00:21:08.293 --> 00:21:11.292
I didn't cast my vote...

346
00:21:11.293 --> 00:21:14.001
so how can he be my Chief Minister.

347
00:21:15.001 --> 00:21:17.210
What's the point of killing you?

348
00:21:18.168 --> 00:21:20.125
You can be happy with your son?

349
00:21:20.126 --> 00:21:22.375
I will renounce this world.

350
00:21:22.376 --> 00:21:26.376
Ghunghroo... you don't have
to punish yourself for my mistakes.

351
00:21:26.751 --> 00:21:32.751
You know we couldn't beget
a child even after numerous efforts.

352
00:21:33.376 --> 00:21:37.335
Lot of people called you uncle..

353
00:21:37.668 --> 00:21:40.251
But no one called you papa.

354
00:21:40.501 --> 00:21:42.501
Daddy... papa.

355
00:21:42.668 --> 00:21:45.376
You're very lucky, Ghunghroo.

356
00:21:46.293 --> 00:21:51.626
Not many fathers
get a young-grownup son.

357
00:21:52.293 --> 00:21:54.750
No hassles of dropping
or picking up from school.

358
00:21:54.751 --> 00:21:57.835
No college... no donations.

359
00:21:58.001 --> 00:21:59.625
Direct son.

360
00:21:59.626 --> 00:22:02.501
And what about when you're dead?

361
00:22:03.376 --> 00:22:05.626
Who will perform your final rites?

362
00:22:05.918 --> 00:22:08.210
You'll wander around as a ghost.

363
00:22:08.793 --> 00:22:12.875
And if your son performs your
final rites... you'll get salvation.

364
00:22:12.876 --> 00:22:16.876
He isn't just your son,
he's a boon for us.

365
00:22:17.168 --> 00:22:19.001
Say something, Ghoongroo!

366
00:22:19.418 --> 00:22:21.335
Say something.

367
00:22:22.376 --> 00:22:25.376
Take me to my son.

368
00:22:26.126 --> 00:22:28.585
- Take me to my son.
- Ghoongroo!

369
00:22:45.543 --> 00:22:47.501
Hello.

370
00:22:47.668 --> 00:22:49.250
Hello, Ghoongroo sir.

371
00:22:49.251 --> 00:22:50.452
We paid a visit to your home..

372
00:22:50.501 --> 00:22:52.742
And found out that you're
heading towards the airport.

373
00:22:52.766 --> 00:22:55.085
And so we thought we'll
seize on you on the way.

374
00:22:55.793 --> 00:22:56.793
Seize.

375
00:22:56.918 --> 00:22:58.876
What a great thought.

376
00:22:59.126 --> 00:23:01.126
By the way...
where are you headed?

377
00:23:01.293 --> 00:23:02.501
India, to see our son.

378
00:23:02.668 --> 00:23:03.668
What?

379
00:23:05.793 --> 00:23:06.501
Son?

380
00:23:06.668 --> 00:23:09.251
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

381
00:23:09.418 --> 00:23:14.751
- You have a son?
- Yes, our son.

382
00:23:15.043 --> 00:23:17.376
- Your son?
- More than a son.

383
00:23:17.543 --> 00:23:19.126
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

384
00:23:19.293 --> 00:23:20.376
Wait!

385
00:23:21.543 --> 00:23:23.126
You never told us you had a son.

386
00:23:23.293 --> 00:23:24.710
What do you mean by we didn't.

387
00:23:24.876 --> 00:23:26.636
I've a paternal and
a maternal uncle as well.

388
00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:28.292
I never told you
about them either.

389
00:23:28.293 --> 00:23:29.876
He lives in India.
We hardly meet him.

390
00:23:30.043 --> 00:23:31.751
So what is all the questions for?

391
00:23:31.918 --> 00:23:33.751
No... no... don't get angry.

392
00:23:34.251 --> 00:23:36.335
- Is he a bachelor?
- Is he?

393
00:23:37.626 --> 00:23:39.426
You don't know whether
he's a bachelor or not?

394
00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:41.751
I said he is a bachelor?

395
00:23:41.918 --> 00:23:44.875
You think I am being rhetorical.

396
00:23:44.876 --> 00:23:47.000
He's a bachelor...

397
00:23:47.001 --> 00:23:49.167
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

398
00:23:49.168 --> 00:23:51.876
That's exactly why we were
coming to see you, Ghunghroo,

399
00:23:52.043 --> 00:23:54.083
So that you tell us of
a decent boy in your family..

400
00:23:54.107 --> 00:23:56.500
And we get our
sister married to him.

401
00:23:56.501 --> 00:23:57.501
Sister?

402
00:23:57.793 --> 00:23:59.710
You never told me
you've another sister.

403
00:23:59.876 --> 00:24:01.626
- You didn't know either.
- Not me, it's his.

404
00:24:01.793 --> 00:24:02.960
I mean... mine too.

405
00:24:03.126 --> 00:24:05.292
His kid sister.

406
00:24:05.293 --> 00:24:06.917
Probably... the last one.

407
00:24:06.918 --> 00:24:08.501
With the grace of God
I've everything.

408
00:24:08.668 --> 00:24:10.500
Fame, Fortune... Respect.

409
00:24:10.501 --> 00:24:13.667
And thanks to my father...
I've three mothers.

410
00:24:13.668 --> 00:24:15.167
- Three mothers?
- Yes.

411
00:24:15.168 --> 00:24:16.667
Since we'll be related soon..

412
00:24:16.668 --> 00:24:18.308
There's no point
in hiding it from you.

413
00:24:18.418 --> 00:24:20.875
I've a kid sister
from the third mother.

414
00:24:20.876 --> 00:24:24.085
Great... he's got a sister.

415
00:24:24.418 --> 00:24:27.250
- You don't look surprised?
- Why should I?

416
00:24:27.251 --> 00:24:28.792
It happens with everyone.

417
00:24:28.793 --> 00:24:30.251
Some suddenly finds a sister..

418
00:24:30.418 --> 00:24:33.001
And some find a son, right.

419
00:24:33.293 --> 00:24:35.501
She's really cute,
cultured, decent and beautiful.

420
00:24:35.668 --> 00:24:38.042
All I want is that you accept
her as your daughter-in-law.

421
00:24:38.043 --> 00:24:41.292
Consider it done, Uday.
It's a yes.

422
00:24:41.293 --> 00:24:43.501
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

423
00:24:43.668 --> 00:24:45.125
Hold on.

424
00:24:45.126 --> 00:24:47.751
- Let me meet my son once.
- What?

425
00:24:47.918 --> 00:24:50.376
I mean... you meet my son once.

426
00:24:50.543 --> 00:24:51.750
What's to see?

427
00:24:51.751 --> 00:24:55.126
Father's like sugar-cane...
so the son must be like jiggery.

428
00:24:55.293 --> 00:24:58.000
Hey... Can't you can
give a decent example?

429
00:24:58.001 --> 00:24:59.960
Then you give one.

430
00:25:00.168 --> 00:25:02.335
We're standing at the
threshold of the temple..

431
00:25:02.501 --> 00:25:04.251
Then we're bound
to find God Inside.

432
00:25:04.418 --> 00:25:06.750
We know you,
there's no need to see your son.

433
00:25:06.751 --> 00:25:08.417
We can have no second thoughts..

434
00:25:08.418 --> 00:25:11.417
About a respectable,
decent and handsome man like you.

435
00:25:11.418 --> 00:25:14.667
- Listen to me..
- We can talk later.

436
00:25:14.668 --> 00:25:16.501
It's a yes from us.

437
00:25:16.876 --> 00:25:18.126
Yes.

438
00:25:18.293 --> 00:25:21.292
Rascals... congratulate them now.

439
00:25:21.293 --> 00:25:23.875
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

440
00:25:23.876 --> 00:25:27.751
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

441
00:25:35.793 --> 00:25:40.042
Come on... it's Ajju bhai's birthday.

442
00:25:40.043 --> 00:25:41.626
Come on, aunty... pay up.

443
00:25:41.793 --> 00:25:42.960
Stop. Stop.

444
00:25:43.376 --> 00:25:45.917
It's Ajju bhai's birthday.

445
00:25:45.918 --> 00:25:48.876
He's here... he's here...

446
00:25:49.043 --> 00:25:50.501
Another one..

447
00:25:52.168 --> 00:25:53.376
Why are you begging?

448
00:25:53.543 --> 00:25:55.501
We're collecting donation.

449
00:25:55.668 --> 00:25:58.126
It's the same thing,
only different spelling.

450
00:25:58.293 --> 00:25:59.573
Why are you collecting donation?

451
00:25:59.597 --> 00:26:01.251
It's Ajju bhai's birthday.

452
00:26:01.418 --> 00:26:02.585
- Birthday?
- Yes.

453
00:26:02.751 --> 00:26:05.585
I've heard about Gandhi
Jayanti... Ambedkar Jayanti.

454
00:26:05.751 --> 00:26:08.167
Was your bhai some freedom fighter?

455
00:26:08.168 --> 00:26:10.251
Yes, he's a freedom fighter.

456
00:26:10.418 --> 00:26:12.917
He fights wherever he gets freedom.

457
00:26:12.918 --> 00:26:14.376
Come on, pay "P-

458
00:26:14.543 --> 00:26:16.835
Stop arguing, just pay them.

459
00:26:17.251 --> 00:26:20.626
- Fine... 11 rupees.
- Not 11 rupees... we want 11,000.

460
00:26:20.793 --> 00:26:22.335
11,000?

461
00:26:22.918 --> 00:26:25.438
Did your mother or your father
leave that kind of money with me?

462
00:26:26.168 --> 00:26:27.168
Hey...

463
00:26:27.543 --> 00:26:29.500
Maybe you don't know who I am.

464
00:26:29.501 --> 00:26:32.376
Hey lady... you don't
know who Ajju bhai is.

465
00:26:32.543 --> 00:26:34.835
Look.
Turn around.

466
00:26:38.085 --> 00:26:46.001
Ajju bhai.. Ajju bhai..
Ajju bhai.. Ajju bhai..

467
00:27:07.418 --> 00:27:10.251
"I am a stormy soda."

468
00:27:11.251 --> 00:27:14.001
"I am the queen of carom."

469
00:27:15.043 --> 00:27:18.001
"I am a spicy fritter."

470
00:27:18.793 --> 00:27:21.626
"Makes your mouth water."

471
00:27:22.668 --> 00:27:25.626
"I am a match a stick."

472
00:27:25.918 --> 00:27:29.376
"That can light a wet cigarette."

473
00:27:30.043 --> 00:27:34.626
"Even rowdy's get sentimental for me."

474
00:27:35.668 --> 00:27:43.126
"I became Bubli and you became Bunty."

475
00:27:43.293 --> 00:27:46.751
"And we played 20-20
in a closed room."

476
00:27:46.918 --> 00:27:50.750
"I became Bubli and you became Bunty."

477
00:27:50.751 --> 00:27:54.501
"And we played 20-20
