495
00:29:40.876 --> 00:29:43.585
He's played enough 20-20, daddy.

496
00:29:43.751 --> 00:29:44.751
Yeah.

497
00:29:44.793 --> 00:29:47.876
Now slice his body into
50-50 and end this match.

498
00:29:48.043 --> 00:29:52.001
