503
00:30:07.293 --> 00:30:15.293
"Fleece me...
Fleece me... Fleece me.."

504
00:30:18.668 --> 00:30:22.085
"Fleece me...
Fleece me... Fleece me.."

505
00:30:22.251 --> 00:30:25.876
"Fleece me...
Fleece me... Fleece me.."

506
00:30:26.043 --> 00:30:28.835
"Fleece me...
Fleece me... Fleece me.."

507
00:30:31.668 --> 00:30:34.626
Aslam. Take my father inside.

508
00:30:34.793 --> 00:30:37.710
Uncle, go that way...
No, not that way.

509
00:30:37.876 --> 00:30:39.501
Dr. Ghunghroo is Ajju's father?

510
00:30:39.668 --> 00:30:41.251
- Aslam, run.
- Come... come..

511
00:30:41.418 --> 00:30:43.210
Kill them both.

