If I had danced so
much in a dance-bar..

576
00:35:17.251 --> 00:35:20.292
I would've made millions.

577
00:35:20.293 --> 00:35:21.792
Majnu, don't beat him.

578
00:35:21.793 --> 00:35:22.293
Don't..

579
