There. Take shots from
different angles, uncle.

628
00:37:35.376 --> 00:37:37.875
- No... one is enough.
- Okay.

629
00:37:37.876 --> 00:37:40.876
I just need to break-off
this relation, not kill the girl.

630
00:37:41.126 --> 00:37:42.585
- One's enough.
- Okay.

631
