Go on.

665
00:39:18.043 --> 00:39:21.501
- Boss, you make a dumb guy talk too much.
- That's how I am.

666
00:39:23.168 --> 00:39:25.085
- How are you sweetheart?
- Rascal.

667
00:39:25.251 --> 00:39:26.876
